  "body": "## Fincept Terminal v4.5.3\n\nNative C++20 financial intelligence terminal — Qt6, embedded Python analytics, 50+ screens.\n\n### Downloads\n\n| Platform | File | Install |\n|----------|------|---------|\n| **Windows x64** | `FinceptTerminal-*-setup*.exe` | Run installer |\n| **Linux (Flatpak, any distribution)** | `FinceptTerminal-*-linux-x86_64.flatpak` | `flatpak install --user ./FinceptTerminal-*.flatpak`, then `flatpak run in.fincept.FinceptTerminal` |\n| **Linux (Debian/Ubuntu .deb)** | `FinceptTerminal-*-linux-x64.deb` | `sudo apt install ./FinceptTerminal-*.deb` |\n| **macOS Apple Silicon** | `FinceptTerminal-*.dmg` or setup | Open DMG → drag to Applications |\n\n### Requirements\n- Windows 10/11 x64\n- Linux Flatpak: any x86_64 Linux with Flatpak; its runtime (org.kde.Platform 6.11) is installed from Flathub on first install\n- Linux .deb: Ubuntu 22.04+ / Debian 12+ and derivatives (x86_64, glibc 2.35+). Fedora, RHEL, Arch, openSUSE and others: use the Flatpak\n- The AppImage and .rpm are no longer published\n- macOS 13+ (Apple Silicon)\n\nSee the [README](https://github.com/Fincept-Corporation/FinceptTerminal#readme) for full installation instructions.\n",
